ill extend invitations to a vetted list of trusted bio red-teamers and review new applications. Once selected, successful applicants will be onboarded to the bio bug bounty platform.\n\n  * Disclosure: All prompts, completions, findings, and communications are covered by NDA.\n\n## How to apply\n\nSubmit a short application here⁠(కొత్త విండోలో తెరుచుకుంటుంది) (name, affiliation, brief track record, and a 150-word plan) by September 15, 2025. Accepted applicants and collaborators must have existing ChatGPT accounts to apply, and will sign a NDA.\n\nApply now and help us make frontier AI safer.\n\n## Apply to the OpenAI GPT‑5 bio bug bounty\n\nApply(కొత్త విండోలో తెరుచుకుంటుంది)\n\n## రచయిత\n\nOpenAI--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nPetri 2.0: New Scenarios, New Model Comparisons, and Improved Eval-Awareness Mitigations (https://alignment.anthropic.com/2026/petri-v2/)\nciteturn3160search11 [wordlim: 200] Published: 8 months ago; Crawled: 2 days ago; Title: Winter Demand Forecasting Model ... This letter serves as my resignation from Chennai Municipal Corporation, effective September 15, 2025. ... Effective: September 16, 2025, 06:00 IST\n"
